            <li>Blocks, Procs & Lambdas</li>
            <li>Métaprogrammation</li>
            <li>Modules avancés & Mixin Patterns</li>
            <li>Duck Typing & Polymorphisme Ruby</li>
            <li>Garbage Collection & Object Model</li>
            <li>Threading, Fibers & Concurrency</li>
            <li>Refinements</li>
            <li>DSL Design</li>
            <li>Pattern Matching</li>
            <li>C Extensions & FFI</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-group">
          <div class="skill-info">
            <span>Ruby on Rails</span>
            <span class="skill-percent">80%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 80%;"></div></div>
